{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmzhg2XMi5gng5mj9cLj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd take the second one, the one that puts each company together, \"קיבוץ לפי חברה\". I'm only fairly sure, and none of them really spoke to me.\n\n**What decided it:** in that one I find a name I know, Harel, and under it all of Harel's tracks one after the other. Near the bottom I can find something that sounds safe, \"אג\"ח סחיר\" or \"כספי (שקלי)\", and see what it costs. The first one opens straight with \"עוקב מדד s&p 500\", English letters and shares. I felt it wasn't for me and would have closed it there. The third one, \"טבלת חברות מול סוגים\", carries the designers' \"מומלץ\" mark. But it's a wall of little percentages in brown squares that look almost the same, and I couldn't tell what the light and dark brown meant.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** the title and the three buttons at the top. Then the first list: S&P, Menora, Altshuler, with numbers like \"13.79%\" and \"674 מיליון\".\n- **Screen 2:** the second option, opening with Harel and its \"16 מסלולים\". The first numbers there were \"24.04%\" next to \"מניות\", which made me nervous.\n- **Screen 3:** more Harel rows. There I found \"הראל גמל להשקעה כספי (שקלי)\" with \"4.25%\" for 3 years and \"0.57%\" fee. That's the only line I understood a bit. Then Mor's rows, and by then I was tired.\n- **Screens 4 and 5:** I only glanced at the table with the coloured squares and the list underneath. I didn't really read them.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"s&p 500\", \"עוקב מדדים\", \"עוקב מדדים – גמיש\", \"מט\"ח\", \"חשיפה\", and \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". I didn't understand \"מהחיסכון\" against \"מההפקדה\" either. Why are there two fees? The little yellow and turquoise rings, and the small clocks next to each number, meant nothing to me. Neither did \"שם הלכה יהודי\" or \"חדש\". The grey lines under the tables and the orange line near the end were too small and pale for me to read, even enlarged.\n\n**What wore me out:** every single row repeats the same \"מניות ● / מט\"ח ●\", the same \"מהחיסכון / מההפקדה\" and the same little clocks. I had to read them again on every line just to find the one number that changes. The whole thing is dark with little grey letters, and lots of numbers. I'd have stopped on the third screen.\n\n**What's missing:** nowhere does it say in a sentence which track is safe like a deposit, or how it compares to my deposit at the bank. I didn't see my bank at all. There are only insurance companies here: Harel, Migdal, Clal, Menora. So I'd still want to ask you, or the bank, before I move anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7069,"cache_read_input_tokens":14902,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7069},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07ce7be2-7a4e-4d1d-a52e-f48a04c199b4","uuid":"6c84b9e8-81c6-44b3-9025-6cebe8aa4e8a","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:32:55.224Z","request_id":"req_011CgmzhfmAACtqqv973c7pD"}
